<div class="sample-articles">
<h3 class="mt-7 mb-3 text-2xl leading-8 font-extrabold font-header tracking-tight text-green-bright sm:text-2xl"><a class="underline" href="/demo/substack/">More Substack articles</a>:</h3>
<p>I manually <b>mocked-up sample articles</b> from selected Substack authors to demonstrate how Substack would look like if it used CiteIt's contextual contacts:</p>

    <ul class="disc">
    <li{% if '/kenklippenstein.com/' in page.url %} class="active"{% endif %}><strong>Ken Klippenstein</strong> (Journalist)
        <ul>
            <li{% if page.url == '/demo/substack/www.kenklippenstein.com/p/jd-vance-on-war-and-peace/' %} class="active"{% endif %}><a href="/demo/substack/www.kenklippenstein.com/p/jd-vance-on-war-and-peace/">JD Vance on War and Peace</a></li>
            <li{% if page.url == '/demo/substack/www.kenklippenstein.com/p/biden-takes-swipe-at-campus-protesters-snubbing-youth-support/' %} class="active"{% endif %}><a href="/demo/substack/www.kenklippenstein.com/p/biden-takes-swipe-at-campus-protesters-snubbing-youth-support/">Biden Takes Swipe at Campus Protesters, Snubbing Youth Support</a></li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li{% if '/racket.news/' in page.url %} class="active"{% endif %}><strong>Matt Taibbi</strong> (Journalist)
        <ul>
            <li{% if page.url == '/demo/substack/www.racket.news/p/who-blew-up-the-nord-stream-pipelines/' %} class="active"{% endif %}><a href="/demo/substack/www.racket.news/p/who-blew-up-the-nord-stream-pipelines/">Who Blew Up the Nord Stream Pipelines? "Russia, Russia, Russia!"</a></li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li{% if '/doomberg.com/' in page.url %} class="active"{% endif %}><strong>Doomberg</strong>: Substack's #1 Paid Finance Newsletter.
        <ul>
            <li{% if page.url == '/demo/substack/newsletter.doomberg.com/p/a-brief-history-of-times/' %} class="active"{% endif %}><a href="/demo/substack/newsletter.doomberg.com/p/a-brief-history-of-times/">A Brief History of Times</a></li>
            <li{% if 'alices-adventures-in-wonderland' in page.url %} class="active"{% endif %}><a href="/demo.citeit.net/2025/11/13/alices-adventures-in-wonderland/">Classics Read Aloud</a>: Alice &amp; Wonderland (Demo)</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li{% if '/columnblog.com/' in page.url %} class="active"{% endif %}><strong>Adam Johnson</strong> &nbsp; <span class="title">(Citations Needed, The Column)</span>
